<http://www.spektrix.com/nationalmusiccentre/event/182401AVQRJLLQKJHHRHJLQDDLMVNBNDL>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "King & NMC Present - Gbèdu: An Afro-Jazz Orchestral Experience";
  schema:description """
	Following a sold-out debut, Nigerian-Canadian composer King Udofia returns with the second edition of Gbèdu presented with National Music Centre. His 21-piece orchestra takes the Studio Bell stage for an immersive evening of horn-driven grooves, heavy percussion, and lush orchestral strings. Audiences are invited to sing, clap, and dance, as they experience a contemporary celebration of African music and culture.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Studio+Bell,+home+of+the+National+Music+Centre/@51.0445506,-114.054786,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x53717aaa864fd43b:0x7609799479e4d20e!8m2!3d51.0445591!4d-114.0529828\">Studio Bell, 850 4 Street SE Calgary</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Doors: 6:30 pm. Show: 7:30 pm.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>General Admission: $60.00 + GST and service charges<span><br/></span>Early Bird Pricing for first 50 tickets sold<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Members receive 15% off — just log into your NMC account and it’s applied automatically. Discounts cannot be combined with other offers.<span><br/></span>
""";
