<http://www.spektrix.com/nationalmusiccentre/event/179001AHMHLVDRHJDLMNNLCQJJHJJCLJH>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "King Eddy Three-Course Dinner (August 22)";
  schema:description """
	KING EDDY DINNER ADD-ON<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In addition to your ticket, you can also join us at the King Eddy for an evening of great food before the Tragically Hip rebroadcast at 7:00 pm. Dinner service begins at 4:30 pm.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>After purchasing your tickets, please call the King Eddy at 403-829-6016 to make your reservation. Please note that tickets are non-refundable.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">FIRST COURSE</span><span><br/></span>Roasted tomato and fennel bisque, crème fraîche garnish<span><br/></span>OR<span><br/></span>Arugula, roasted pear and almond salad with a lemon Dijon vinaigrette<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">SECOND COURSE</span><span><br/></span>Slow roasted beef striploin, carrot purée, roasted asparagus, new potatoes, red wine and herb sauce<span><br/></span>OR<span><br/></span>Grilled garlic jumbo prawns, roasted mushroom, spinach and tomato risotto<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">THIRD COURSE</span><span><br/></span>White chocolate and cranberry brioche bread pudding, salted caramel sauce, vanilla gelato<span><br/></span>OR<span><br/></span>Bailey’s crème caramel<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>*Vegetarian option available upon request
""";
