<http://www.spektrix.com/nationalmusiccentre/event/172001ATNHPPKRRKJVVPDDCVSQJGMVCHM>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "King Eddy Three-Course Dinner (June 26)";
  schema:description """
	KING EDDY DINNER ADD-ON<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In addition to your ticket, you can also purchase a three course meal before-hand at The King Eddy Restaurant.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>After purchasing your tickets, please call the King Eddy at 403-829-6016 to make your reservation. Please note that tickets are non-refundable.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">FIRST COURSE</span><span><br/></span>Maple roasted butternut squash and coconut cream soup with toasted pumpkin seeds and cilantro pesto<span><br/></span>OR<span><br/></span>Mediterranean chopped salad with romaine lettuce, arugula, tomato, cucumber, chickpeas, olives, feta cheese, and red wine vinaigrette<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">SECOND COURSE</span><span><br/></span>Slow-braised Alberta beef short ribs with red wine and herbs, served with garlic mashed potatoes and vegetables<span><br/></span>OR<span><br/></span>Chicken breast supreme “Coq au vin” with red wine, bacon, mushroom, and herb jus, served with garlic mashed potatoes and vegetables<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">THIRD COURSE</span><span><br/></span>Maple bourbon crème brûlée served with Chantilly cream and fresh berries<span><br/></span>OR<span><br/></span>Baileys crème caramel
""";
