<http://www.spektrix.com/nationalmusiccentre/event/184601ARLMKLDPDCBVNPLLVTCPPNDQKHP>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Live From the King Eddy: The Free Label";
  schema:description """
	This isn’t just a concert. You’re going to be on the record.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>On September 26 and 27, the National Music Centre (NMC) launches Live from the King Eddy—a new live recording series that puts you in the room as an album is captured in real time—and we’re kicking it off with The Free Label.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Studio+Bell,+home+of+the+National+Music+Centre/@51.0445506,-114.054786,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x53717aaa864fd43b:0x7609799479e4d20e!8m2!3d51.0445591!4d-114.0529828\">Studio Bell, 850 4 Street SE Calgary</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Doors: 7:00 pm. Show: 8:00 pm.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $45 + GST<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Members receive 15% off General tickets — just log into your NMC account and it’s applied automatically. The NMC Member discount cannot be combined with the Early Bird discount.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please note: this event is standing room. Limited seating is available on a first-come, first-served basis. Guests with accessibility needs, please contact info@kingeddy.ca or 403-829-6016.
""";
