<http://www.spektrix.com/nationalmusiccentre/event/182001ARVDSTLMBDJGHRCRLNDSLMLGKRD>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Music Production Workshop with Will Maclellan";
  schema:description """
	<span><br/></span>Join JUNO Award-winning producer, engineer, and musician Will Maclellan for an immersive half-day workshop inside National Music Centre’s Recording Studios. Designed for music production enthusiasts, emerging creators, and working professionals, this session blends practical studio insight with thoughtful discussion on the creative and technical choices that shape a finished recording.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Studio+Bell,+home+of+the+National+Music+Centre/@51.0445506,-114.054786,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x53717aaa864fd43b:0x7609799479e4d20e!8m2!3d51.0445591!4d-114.0529828\">Studio Bell, 850 4 Street SE Calgary</a><span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>Workshop starts at 3:00 pm<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>General: $50.00 + GST 
<span><br/></span>NMC Members receive an automatic 20% discount when logged into their account.<span><br/></span>
""";
