<http://www.spektrix.com/nationalmusiccentre/event/162801ATDVQVDSHSJBMNQMSVBCLGCKJBT>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "NMC & Alliance Française Present: A Kora Journey - Strings of Legacy ";
  schema:description """
	On Sunday, March 1, discover an exceptional concert where tradition meets innovation.<span><br/></span>Featuring Zal Sissokho and Senny Camara on kora and vocals, this performance takes you on a unique musical journey. On stage, the two artists weave a subtle and moving dialogue. Their voices and koras blend to create a vibrant music, exploring love and uniqueness.<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Studio+Bell,+home+of+the+National+Music+Centre/@51.0445506,-114.054786,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x53717aaa864fd43b:0x7609799479e4d20e!8m2!3d51.0445591!4d-114.0529828\">Studio Bell, 850 4 Street SE Calgary</a><span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>Doors: 6:30 pm. Show: 7:30 pm.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $35 + GST and fees<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>NMC Members and Alliance Française Members get 15% off. NMC Members will automatically see their discount when logged into their account.  Alliance Française Members can receive the same discount by applying a promo code at checkout
""";
