<http://www.spektrix.com/nationalmusiccentre/event/187201ATQTBPJHSKGGTCNKDVLSTDMSVGK>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Oscill8 x NMC Present: SYNC Sound and Image Conference";
  schema:description """
	SYNC 2026: Sound and Image Conference brings electronic music, digital art, live visuals, and video together. It’s your chance to explore new ideas, discover exciting artists, learn something useful, and connect with people who are passionate about music, technology, and digital creativity. Participate in engaging workshops, discussions, demonstrations, and hands-on sessions with artists and industry professionals. Meet collaborators, make new connections, and get inspired by what other people in the community are creating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Studio+Bell,+home+of+the+National+Music+Centre/@51.0445506,-114.054786,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x53717aaa864fd43b:0x7609799479e4d20e!8m2!3d51.0445591!4d-114.0529828\">Studio Bell, 850 4 Street SE Calgary</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Doors: 10:00 am<span><br/></span>Workshops: 12:00 pm<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All Workshop Pass: $77.70 (GST and fees included)<span><br/></span>Early Bird: $56.70 (GST and fees included)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Single Workshop: $33.70 (GST and fees included)<span><br/></span>Early Bird:$23.20  (GST and fees included)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>*Early Bird discount for first 10 tickets sold<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Members receive 15% off — just log into your NMC account and it’s applied automatically.
""";
