  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Sam Demma Presents: Be Someone's Taco";
  schema:description """
	Inspired by a heartfelt real-life experience, Be Someone’s Taco is coming to Calgary as a powerful public event celebrating kindness, empathy, and small acts of service.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Studio+Bell,+home+of+the+National+Music+Centre/@51.0445506,-114.054786,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x53717aaa864fd43b:0x7609799479e4d20e!8m2!3d51.0445591!4d-114.0529828\">Studio Bell, 850 4 Street SE Calgary</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Doors: 6:00 pm.<span><br/></span>Show: 7:00 pm.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Sam Demma's books <span class=\"ItalicText\">Empty Your Backpack</span> and <span class=\"ItalicText\">Be Someone's Taco</span> are available to purchase with your ticket.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Ticket: $20<span><br/></span>Ticket + Be Someone’s Taco: $30<span><br/></span>Ticket + Be Someone’s Taco + Empty Your Backpack: $37.5<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>+ GST
""";
