<http://www.spektrix.com/nationalmusiccentre/event/181201ASRVGRNHSCPQQRJBTSNDMVVRPDR>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Sam Demma: Return on Goodwill";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"ItalicText\">Return on Goodwill</span> LIVE is coming to Calgary as part of an exclusive 10-city book launch tour. Bestselling author and international keynote speaker <span class=\"BoldText\">Sam Demma</span> is launching his new book, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Return on Goodwill</span>, the only way he knows how: on stage, in person, with you in the room.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This isn't a lecture. This is a full-throttle storytelling experience that will have you laughing one moment and wiping tears the next, then walking out the doors ready to change how you move through the world.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Studio+Bell,+home+of+the+National+Music+Centre/@51.0445506,-114.054786,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x53717aaa864fd43b:0x7609799479e4d20e!8m2!3d51.0445591!4d-114.0529828\">Studio Bell, 850 4 Street SE Calgary</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Doors: 6:00 pm. Show: 7:00 pm.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Ticket: $25.00 + GST <span><br/></span>Ticket + Return on Goodwill Book: $40.00 + GST<span><br/></span>Ticket + Return on Goodwill + Empty Your Backpack Book: $47.50 + GST
""";
