<http://www.spektrix.com/nationalmusiccentre/event/185601AGVPLKVNTQNSRKLPLGBJPBQRKJB>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "StoryMusic, Green Fools Theatre & NMC Present: Little Red Riding Hood with Beethoven";
  schema:description """
	National Music Centre, StoryMusic, and Green Fools Theatre team up to present Little Red Riding Hood with Beethoven — a one-of-a-kind storytelling concert with live music and puppetry! This show features Beethoven's dynamic String Quartet No. 11 with Liza Scriggins' version of the much-loved fairy tale and puppets by Green Fools Theatre for an all-ages multimedia celebration of stories and music.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Studio+Bell,+home+of+the+National+Music+Centre/@51.0445506,-114.054786,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x53717aaa864fd43b:0x7609799479e4d20e!8m2!3d51.0445591!4d-114.0529828\">Studio Bell, 850 4 Street SE Calgary</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Early Show:<span><br/></span>Doors: 12:30 pm. Show: 1:00 pm.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Late Show:<span><br/></span>Doors: 2:45 pm. Show: 3:15 pm.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Adult: $20.00 (GST included)<span><br/></span>Children/Students/Seniors: $15.00 (GST included)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Members receive 15% off — just log into your NMC account and it’s applied automatically.
""";
