<http://www.spektrix.com/nationalmusiccentre/event/181601AMDGMGCVHRRCSPJGDHJJSKSKLJD>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Synth Soundbath: Waldorf Wave";
  schema:description """
	Join us at Studio Bell, home of the National Music Centre, for Synth Soundbath, a monthly series exploring the intersection of wellness and music technology.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Studio+Bell,+home+of+the+National+Music+Centre/@51.0445506,-114.054786,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x53717aaa864fd43b:0x7609799479e4d20e!8m2!3d51.0445591!4d-114.0529828\">Studio Bell, 850 4 Street SE Calgary</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Doors: 10:30 am. <span><br/></span>Start time: 11:00 am. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $19 + GST<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Studio Bell admission is not included with your ticket. To visit Studio Bell, simply present your Synth Soundbath ticket at the Visitor Experience Desk to receive a special admission rate of $15.00.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>NMC Members receive 15% off. Sign in online using the email address associated with your membership, and your discount will be automatically applied in your cart at checkout.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Love Synth Soundbath? Become an NMC Member! Enjoy free admission to Studio Bell, 15% off Synth Soundbath tickets, and discounts on future events throughout the year.
""";
